    <h5 class="display-4">About Us</h5>
    <p class="lead" align="justify" style="font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;">
    &emsp; Having an online system to find doctors can help eliminate the trouble of visiting every other hospital to get an appointment, saving you some time without affecting your health. The Online Doctor Finder system will help to find the doctor in their nearby area with complete details of each doctor.

We have designed an Online Doctor Finder project in spring boot & hibernate, which has two main roles i.e. Admin and User. Admin is the primary user. Admin can add/remove/update any details related to the system, update fees of the doctors & their appointments, treatments, and other services, View/Confirm/Cancel appointment booking done by Users, and so on. Admin can manage doctors’ details and also, keep the records of the Users, etc.
  </p>
   <p class="lead" align="justify" style="font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;"> The technology used is Spring Framework and at the data access layer we have used Hibernate
    which is an ORM(Object Relational Model). The database used here is MYSQL which again
    is a popular relational database. For the Look and feel of the application we have used 
    HTML, CSS, Bootstrap and JS.</p>
    
